# FishData Rwanda

FishData Rwanda is a student hackathon project that makes publicly available fisheries and aquaculture information in Rwanda easier to explore and understand.

**Live demo:** https://fishdatarwa.vercel.app/

## Mission
To make fisheries data more accessible through an interactive dashboard that helps people explore production, growing systems, locations, and market information.

## Features
- Overview of Rwanda's aquaculture and fisheries sector
- Production performance
- Growing systems
- Locations where fish-sector activity happens
- Market and regional demand
- Sources, definitions and data quality notes
- About page with a QR code linking to the live dashboard
- Multi-language support (English, Kinyarwanda, French, Kiswahili, Luganda)
- Works on phones and computers

## Tech
- HTML (single-file dashboard, no installation needed)

## How to run
1. Download `index.html`.
2. Open it in any web browser.

